A new chance discovery makes me add a postscript. Let those who will not believe in unmistakable marks of a master\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s style and form compare the first movement of the symphony with the first movement of Haydn
\loch\af0\dbch\af13\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s string quartet, Op. \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 3, \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 No. 4, also in B}{
