\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 ,}{\cf0\revised\lang1033\langfe2052\revauth1\revdttm1719227748\langnp1033\insrsid14487584 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  flat}{\lang1033\langfe2052\crauth1\crdate1719227730\langnp1033\insrsid1856048\charrsid8401775 {\*\oldcprops 
\crauth1\crdate1719227730\charrsid8401775 }\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
, published three years before the symphony. They will find, notwithstanding a difference in measure, a curious similarity from the very beginning; and they will find moreover that the second subject which I poin\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
ted out to be a fingerprint of Haydn\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s style, is almost identical in both pieces throughout its whole extension of about twenty bars. So the whole mystery of doubtful facts is cleared finally by Haydn himself.}{
